message:
Update: Alderwick General Insurance has confirmed that the claim notification for 129 Maple Walk, Brackenford, ZZ4 2ZZ has been registered. They have stated that this confirmation records registration only and is not a decision on cover, so no view on liability or payment has been given at this stage.

Next steps on your side, please, as and when available:
- the date/approximate date the tenant first noticed the dampness, and anything they observed beforehand;
- the emergency contractor's findings on the source of the leak and whether it is now isolated;
- the rooms/areas affected, plus any dated photographs and the contractor's report or invoice.

Please continue to use a qualified contractor for any containment or investigation work, and do not attempt repairs yourself. I will ask the insurer for the claim reference and their required next steps and will pass those on as soon as I have them.
